ties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}}, "cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.37.0", "Node name for S&R": "ComfySwitchNode"}, "widgets_values": [false], "widgets_values_named": {"switch": false}}, {"id": 79, "type": "PrimitiveBoolean", "pos": [80, 3408], "size": [270, 58], "flags": {}, "order": 17, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "value", "name": "value", "type": "BOOLEAN", "widget": {"name": "value"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "BOOLEAN", "name": "BOOLEAN", "type": "BOOLEAN", "links": [70]}], "title": "New shot (hard cut, e.g. new location)", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}}, "cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.37.0", "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveBoolean"}, "widgets_values": [false], "widgets_values_named": {"value": false}}, {"id": 80, "type": "H3LongVideoSaveConditioning", "pos": [1523.1763671875, 278], "size": [334.0376953125, 82], "flags": {}, "order": 24, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "conditioning", "name": "conditioning", "type": "CONDITIONING", "link": 102}, {"localized_name": "project", "name": "project", "type": "STRING", "widget": {"name": "project"}, "link": 103}, {"localized_name": "part", "name": "part", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "part"}, "link": 104}], "outputs": [], "title": "Save conditioning (for upscale later)", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}}, "Node name for S&R": "H3LongVideoSaveConditioning"}, "widgets_values": ["my_long_video", 1], "widgets_values_named": {"project": "my_long_video", "part": 1}}, {"id": 81, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [80, -410], "size": [660, 500], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "properties": {}, "widgets_values": ["## PlagueKind Long Video \u2014 one part per run, no length limit\n1. Set **Project name** (folder under `output/long_video/`).\n2. **Part number = 1**, write the first scene in **Scene prompt**, queue.\n3. Happy with it? Set **Part number = 2**, write the next scene (start with *\"Continue the same shot without a cut:\"*), queue. Then 3, 4, ...\n4. Not happy? Queue the **same** part number again (new seed) \u2014 it re-rolls only that part; later parts are moved to `_superseded/`.\n\nEach part continues from the last 39 frames + audio of the previous part (latent copy, no cut). Parts after the first add *seconds \u2212 1.6 s* of new video.\nResult: `output/long_video/<project>/<project>_full.mp4`, rebuilt after every part.\n\n- **Turbo** switch on = turbo LoRA, 8 steps (~8 min per 10 s part instead of ~13). Can be changed between parts.\n- **New shot** switch on = this part starts fresh (hard cut, e.g. a new location; swap Ref 3 to that location) and is still appended. Off = continue the previous part.\n- **SLA attention** switch: off (default) = stable buildings/background; on = ~1/3 faster but straight lines (windows, balconies) wobble and warp.\n- Each part also saves its conditioning, so the project can be upscaled later with **PlagueKind Long Video - Upscale**.\n- Width and height must be multiples of 32 (e.g. 1280\u00d7704, 1152\u00d7864).\n- Keep resolution and refs the same for the whole project.\n- Do NOT add the H3 MiniMax Cache node: it makes continuations ignore the previous part (tested).\n- Dialogue: quoted lines, \"his lips moving clearly\", face toward camera."]}], "links": [[53, 1, 0, 5, 0, "MODEL"], [54, 78, 0, 6, 0, "MODEL"], [55, 6, 0, 7, 0, "MODEL"], [56, 21, 1, 9, 5, "INT"], [57, 73, 0, 9, 0, "MODEL"], [58, 9, 0, 10, 0, "MODEL"], [59, 20, 0, 21, 0, "FLOAT"], [60, 22, 0, 23, 13, "STRING"], [61, 21, 1, 23, 16, "INT"], [62, 2, 0, 23, 0, "CLIP"], [63, 3, 0, 23, 1, "VAE"], [64, 4, 0, 23, 2, "VAE"], [65, 11, 0, 23, 5, "IMAGE"], [66, 12, 0, 23, 6, "IMAGE"], [67, 13, 0, 23, 7, "IMAGE"], [68, 30, 0, 32, 1, "STRING"], [69, 31, 0, 32, 2, "INT"], [70, 79, 0, 32, 5, "BOOLEAN"], [71, 23, 1, 32, 0, "LATENT"], [72, 10, 0, 41, 0, "MODEL"], [73, 23, 0, 41,